===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|pataphysique}}, where it was coined by author {{w|Alfred Jarry}} from a pun deriving from the {{der|en|grc|-}} title of a work by {{w|Aristotle}}; see {{m|fr|pataphysique}} for more.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# An [[absurdist]] [[philosophy]] or [[pseudoscience]] studying things "beyond" [[metaphysics]].

